  "changes": [
    "Gelato now has a central Feed starter and two branching antler stems. Each stem contains fourteen upgrades and forks at depths three, six and nine; six terminal tines contain six, six, five, six, six and four upgrades. All 62 saved family/tier identities remain.",
    "Power1 and Time1 form the separated left/right heads at x=-500 and x=500. Future upgrades are discovered through their real parent. Existing ownership remains visible.",
    "Dual Shot is a separate visible tile below Feed1 while locked. Its purchase still requires tray8 and Power6 and costs3000 coins; existing ownership and Power reset behavior are unchanged.",
    "New antler-garden artwork places two winding trees around the live routes. Current native art and imported texture bytes are verified; retired Gelato arc and both U-garden versions are excluded.",
    "The v0.6.11 combat/economy rebalance and developer settings remain. Both gameplay fingerprints, save handling and Trial rules are unchanged from v0.6.11."
  ],
